    kind: invariant  # 938f
    title: "Rust reaches a clean net_send/fs_write verdict with NO caveat over a denylisted sink method: 10 of 34 catalogued method sinks can never emit a call edge, and call_construct is never stamped so the untyped-receiver disclosure is inert"  # 938f
    status: violated  # 938f
    priority: 1  # 938f
    parent:  # 938f
    tags:  # 938f
